            "detailed_description": "&quot;NewTypes&quot; is a simulation game of virtual spacecraft.<br><br>On physics simulation, you pilot a simple spacecraft (like a handcrafted kart) with thrusters, and get experienses of free flight in space.<br><br>Riding a customized or self-made spacecraft, play dogfight and racing in space. (in development)<br><br>For an overview of development, see the following guide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caution!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You may get 3D sickness. (especially in VR version)<br></li><li>When that happens, stop playing the game and take a break immediately.<br></li><li>But it may be used for training to become an astronaut.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of latest version (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>VR(HTC Vive) version and non VR version included.<br></li><li>Steam controller configuration supported.<br></li><li>You can fly freely in space of beautiful stars.<br></li><li>The real star map is simulated.<br></li><li>You can do training of shooting targets with missiles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limitation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It does not collide with the ISS (International Space Station) yet.<br></li><li>It has various problems.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap for V1.0</h2>",
