                        "review": "Early Access Game\n\nReleased on 20th Feb 2018\nLast Update 13th March 2018\nRemoval: 1st Jan 2027\n\nIts Free, but What?\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/news/app/703030/view/670629928317748096\n[quote]NewTypes will be retired from the Steam store on January 1, 2027\nThank you for playing NewTypes since 2018.\nDevelopment of this version has ended, and the game will be removed from the Steam store on January 1, 2027.\nIf you already have NewTypes in your library, you can keep downloading and playing it after that date. The game has no online services, so nothing will stop working.\nWe are working on a new title and will share news when it's ready.\nMasahiro Suzuki[/quote]\n\nGet it while you can, expect what you paid for (for slow ones, nothing ♥)",
